{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "description": "Pregnancy history form for the CTG Risk Monitor. Fields with in_model = false are shown to the clinician and stored, but do not change the probability: CTU-UHB does not record them, so no likelihood ratio could be fitted for them without local data.",
